----------------------
Actor main

C ----------------------
C Actor main
C ----------------------
C Cs {
All Comp comp
C C
C C }
C
C ----------------------
C Actor refs .
C C    "$${._arg}": { "type": "$${kComp}", "id": $${kMe} },
C
C ----------------------
C Actor childs
C ----------------------
C Cs $${.1., }$${kMe}

All Comp comp_act

----------------------
Actor comp

C C ${.1.,}
C Cs  "${name}": [
C All ${name} gen_${name}
C C
C Cs  ]

----------------------
Actor comp_childs Comp
C Cs    "${name}": [
C Its ${name} childs
C C ],

----------------------
Actor comp_act Comp

C ----------------------
C Actor gen_${name}
C C $${.1.,}
C C   {
C Du refs me
Du check_parent
Its Element gen_fields
Its Comp_parent comp_childs

C C    "payload": $${payload}
C Cs   }

----------------------
Actor gen_fields Element type in ref,link,up_copy,ref_child,ref_copy

C Its ${name} refs ${name}

----------------------
Actor check_parent Comp parent != .

C Its parent refs parent

